- Base: **`feature/refactoring6`** unless user says otherwise.
- **One branch:** keep working on **`cursor/arch-migrate-src-ca70`** (or the user’s existing migration branch). Do **not** create a new branch per slice unless the user asks.
- **Commit + push** after each completed slice; update the **same** open PR.
- Rename a too-narrow branch once via `git branch -m` + push + GitHub branch rename (PR head follows).

## Hard stops

- No `@/legacy/**`, Tier B tables/columns, `apps/web`, monorepo packages without explicit instruction.
- No whole-repo format/lint drive-by.
